                "text": "Let's solve the equation:\n\n\\[\n\\sin(x) + x^2 = 42\n\\]\n\nThis is a transcendental equation, meaning it can't be solved algebraically in a simple way. Instead, we can use numerical methods to find approximate solutions. I'll use Python to solve for \\( x \\).",
